  "body_text": "先插播一个放假通知\n浦东芳华路店 Lovely Thoughts 清明节4.5日店休一天\n浦西北京西路店 Lucky Draw 清明节照常营业\n// 正文，去年的回忆\n前几天看到朋友圈刷了一组去年疫情的照片\n不经想起，一年前的一周前我就在厂里住下了\n随后就是2个多月的厂里起居生活的日子\n此处放置一个打地铺的邋遢照片，但就空着吧，苦日子没啥好看的\n有阵子还可以开着小车子在园区周围兜一圈转转，偶尔晚上还能碰运气碰到偷偷出来卖菜赚点小钱的小青年\n后来，厂区大门也封了，小车闲置下来，天气好时就打开车门晒晒被子\n此处想象下5门都打开，晒着被子和褥子，好像旅居也差不多\n被子是晒好了，但是小车的电池也被耗光了\n后来\n5.31号半夜，跟物业吵了一架，然后吵到了一个可以回家了的结果\n回忆起来，已经没有了那时的紧张、焦躁、无奈和心酸\n好像也没什么感觉了\n//今年，刚刚过去的这个三月\n厂里迎接了新的烘焙机，也加了一套新的上料系统，还装了一台包装机，也增添了一名干将\n此处暂无图片，哈哈哈哈哈~\n定制了一个发酵罐系统，在产区也开始测试一些实验批次，目前结果还不错哦\n我们第一批真正意义的CM ASD日晒，几个不同发酵时长和阶段的批次结果居然有蛮明显的差异，二氧化碳这么神奇的吗？\n我们的瑰夏基地小苗已经种下去了，期待三年后它的首秀\n对，我们开了小红书，目前就是当朋友圈一样在更新一些状态，小红书的店铺晚点再开起来吧\n4月 静安咖啡节，很久没参加活动了，本来上一次静安要做的主题，迟来但总归要来了\n5月 继续产区收尾测试，学习修枝打岔~有助于身心健康\n刚开始的试验批次，要5月才能晒干测试\n芒龙基地低海拔但由于背阴在溪水边，成熟反而是最晚的地块，现在还有很多是全绿果状态\n预计要到5月才陆续采收处理\n6月 6.18，不知道直播能不能上线，继续产区\n....\n好像每个月都已经有很多安排了~\n未来可期，加油！",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content autoTypeSetting24psection\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           先插播一个放假通知\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(0, 209, 0);\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(0, 209, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n            浦东芳华路店 Lovely Thoughts 清明节4.5日店休一天\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           浦西北京西路店 Lucky Draw 清明节照常营业\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n           // 正文，去年的回忆\n          </strong>\n</span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<qqmusic albumid=\"0027psDO2nygqv\" albumurl=\"https://y.gtimg.cn/music/photo_new/T002R68x68M0000027psDO2nygqv.jpg\" audiourl=\"http://isure6.stream.qqmusic.qq.com/C200000QZ4BB1KWTRL.m4a?guid=2000000052&amp;vkey=EB861C99FFA8F19349930309A1B8C1F108A45852DE0EBF024AF32EFA2DFF33CFEB0BA47AFABF96E53DB16C3BDDEABD0048019511A4CA0C01&amp;uin=0&amp;fromtag=20052\" class=\"js_editor_qqmusic qqmusic_iframe js_uneditable custom_select_card\" data-pluginname=\"insertaudio\" jumpurlkey=\"\" mid=\"003tmRMj1wj5tF\" music_name=\"battlecry\" musicid=\"4725161\" musictype=\"1\" otherid=\"003tmRMj1wj5tF\" play_length=\"200\" singer=\"Nujabes - samurai champloo music record departure\" src=\"/mp/readtemplate?t=app_editor/music&amp;singer=Nujabes%20-%20samurai%20champloo%20music%20record%20departure&amp;music_name=battlecry&amp;albumurl=https%3A%2F%2Fy.gtimg.cn%2Fmusic%2Fphoto_new%2FT002R68x68M0000027psDO2nygqv.jpg&amp;musictype=1\">\n</qqmusic>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          前几天看到朋友圈刷了一组去年疫情的照片\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          不经想起，一年前的一周前我就在厂里住下了\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          随后就是2个多月的厂里起居生活的日子\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          此处放置一个打地铺的邋遢照片，但就空着吧，苦日子没啥好看的\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          有阵子还可以开着小车子在园区周围兜一圈转转，偶尔晚上还能碰运气碰到偷偷出来卖菜赚点小钱的小青年\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          后来，厂区大门也封了，小车闲置下来，天气好时就打开车门晒晒被子\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          此处想象下5门都打开，晒着被子和褥子，好像旅居也差不多\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          被子是晒好了，但是小车的电池也被耗光了\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          后来\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          5.31号半夜，跟物业吵了一架，然后吵到了一个可以回家了的结果\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          回忆起来，已经没有了那时的紧张、焦躁、无奈和心酸\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          好像也没什么感觉了\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           //今年，刚刚过去的这个三月\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<qqmusic albumid=\"003YTv6h1erPWt\" albumurl=\"https://y.gtimg.cn/music/photo_new/T002R68x68M000003YTv6h1erPWt.jpg\" audiourl=\"http://isure6.stream.qqmusic.qq.com/C200000sSZbQ0D6AxU.m4a?guid=2000000052&amp;vkey=DA08E32610176753FF05C60A2A9FE2A8840F047E30D5FA75536FFBF01C48790ED977F9AD4D92D184D8156619AA137FDC60A7EB18C0987365&amp;uin=0&amp;fromtag=20052\" class=\"js_editor_qqmusic qqmusic_iframe js_uneditable custom_select_card\" data-pluginname=\"insertaudio\" jumpurlkey=\"\" mid=\"001XlGEv1Cfmb3\" music_name=\"Zone of Zen\" musicid=\"105524032\" musictype=\"1\" otherid=\"001XlGEv1Cfmb3\" play_length=\"210\" singer=\"Shing02;Cradle Orchestra - Zone of Zen\" src=\"/mp/readtemplate?t=app_editor/music&amp;singer=Shing02%3BCradle%20Orchestra%20-%20Zone%20of%20Zen&amp;music_name=Zone%20of%20Zen&amp;albumurl=https%3A%2F%2Fy.gtimg.cn%2Fmusic%2Fphoto_new%2FT002R68x68M000003YTv6h1erPWt.jpg&amp;musictype=1\">\n</qqmusic>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          厂里迎接了新的烘焙机，也加了一套新的上料系统，还装了一台包装机，也增添了一名干将\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          此处暂无图片，哈哈哈哈哈~\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          定制了一个发酵罐系统，在产区也开始测试一些实验批次，目前结果还不错哦\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SYAmHfLYGMQYf1fbdbuqYNWRngJgHaZOo2ncIJaZy6ukZnn7sLn8fPv11oRUmwsia63VZZCyW79Yg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"font-size: 14px;white-space: normal;width: 578px;height: 633px;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          我们第一批真正意义的CM ASD日晒，几个不同发酵时长和阶段的批次结果居然有蛮明显的差异，二氧化碳这么神奇的吗？\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          我们的瑰夏基地小苗已经种下去了，期待三年后它的首秀\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SYAmHfLYGMQYf1fbdbuqYNF5T71ibmVmcrpBNS117JJg5jsWtSH04JmJcIumU7pqEgfQwHswCAPOQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SYAmHfLYGMQYf1fbdbuqYNZvaeibpF5LbQNkTfxHcFsPAXqIZiaicbyic49teg1cfoXWcSO5aLcP8C1w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          对，我们开了小红书，目前就是当朋友圈一样在更新一些状态，小红书的店铺晚点再开起来吧\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          4月 静安咖啡节，很久没参加活动了，本来上一次静安要做的主题，迟来但总归要来了\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          5月 继续产区收尾测试，学习修枝打岔~有助于身心健康\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SYAmHfLYGMQYf1fbdbuqYNTD8j0Nk0RzcM0iavNgaAovu6yUK6kMuMAA4BlywTVxiaMcEmjz9bOKiaw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          刚开始的试验批次，要5月才能晒干测试\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SYAmHfLYGMQYf1fbdbuqYNiaXDuh78R6JBnibs36A07HibTWpxk3kGwIdQau3SFn5bibiaibCwHAmdjKzA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          芒龙基地低海拔但由于背阴在溪水边，成熟反而是最晚的地块，现在还有很多是全绿果状态\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          预计要到5月才陆续采收处理\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          6月 6.18，不知道直播能不能上线，继续产区\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          ....\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          好像每个月都已经有很多安排了~\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          未来可期，加油！\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<qqmusic albumid=\"000Z3HfA3jLfgk\" albumurl=\"https://y.gtimg.cn/music/photo_new/T002R68x68M000000Z3HfA3jLfgk.jpg\" audiourl=\"http://isure6.stream.qqmusic.qq.com/C200000IaDpF0taMFp.m4a?guid=2000000052&amp;vkey=6FD7262F655BBA84E3FCE0EDC631D98294D7D7AC97951DDB9C46DE30FE4D7AD42FBC9DA9305B892912C575DD731B9F722BBFF7B93167D8D0&amp;uin=0&amp;fromtag=20052\" class=\"js_editor_qqmusic qqmusic_iframe js_uneditable custom_select_card\" data-pluginname=\"insertaudio\" jumpurlkey=\"\" mid=\"000IaDpF0taMFp\" music_name=\"RIDE ON TIME\" musicid=\"235211054\" musictype=\"1\" otherid=\"000IaDpF0taMFp\" play_length=\"271\" singer=\"山下達郎 - RIDE ON TIME\" src=\"/mp/readtemplate?t=app_editor/music&amp;singer=%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%8B%E9%81%94%E9%83%8E%20-%20RIDE%20ON%20TIME&amp;music_name=RIDE%20ON%20TIME&amp;albumurl=https%3A%2F%2Fy.gtimg.cn%2Fmusic%2Fphoto_new%2FT002R68x68M000000Z3HfA3jLfgk.jpg&amp;musictype=1\">\n</qqmusic>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"display: none;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
